":"LA","postal_code":"70118","stars":4.5,"review_count":22,"categories":["Latin American","Mexican","Restaurants"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"flr22rkcBITW_8NntgCKUw","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":1547,"mm_rank":1631,"target_category_support_fraction":0.6666666666666666,"selected_image_count":2,"label_diversity":1,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Latin American","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Mexican","historical_business_count":1},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Mexican, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"flr22rkcBITW_8NntgCKUw","review_id":"-i-d8PA2UXSvVJLi9wPgOQ","date":"2021-02-07T03:45:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9281343221664429,"text_excerpt":"OMG this is my Taco Tuesday go to from now on! They have fresh, homemade ttortillas and the varety of taco is more than nay other taco tuesday in the city. I had tongue - you heard me -TONGUE tacos, they were so tender and good! The chicken and the steak were my next favorites. The margarita, the Cadillac margarita, was STRONG. I only needed the one. The tacos are not only incredible and authentic, but it is a great deal at 5 tacos for $10 on Tuesdays. There are so many more things I want to try on the menu. I thought the service was great too. The restaurant is on the smaller side and you have to go up a few steps to get into the restaurant. Limited parking in the front."},{"business_id":"flr22rkcBITW_8NntgCKUw","review_id":"aHfd394xsFqxWKxR3wxznw","date":"2020-11-19T21:51:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9220190048217773,"text_excerpt":"We accidentally went to La Patrona while grabbing a drink at Cooter Brown's. We got 5 street tacos for $10 with thick homemade corn tortillas. They were everything I wanted and you CANNOT beat that price. I go once a week now. Plus, the owner is really nice and stayed open for an extra few minutes one time just so I could get some tacos."},{"business_id":"flr22rkcBITW_8NntgCKUw","review_id":"hV6jCX3N54Ll-ByH3Jux-g","date":"2020-09-06T15:09:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9200750589370728,"text_excerpt":"New Mexican spot on the radar! In my efforts to seek out the best Mexican food in New Orleans, I decided to try this new place that just opened in August. I saw that they were doing 5 tacos for $10 and thought at the very least it would be a good deal. I was pleasantly surprised to find out that not only was the food reasonably priced, it was all delicious! We got the mix nachos, mole enchiladas, and 5 tacos with 3 different pork, carne asada, and cow tongue. Each chip in the nachos was loaded and tasty -- probably my favorite part of the meal. The tacos were all incredible too. They also have great happy hour deals and tasty margaritas, including a jalepeno one. Definitely coming back so..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"flr22rkcBITW_8NntgCKUw","photo_id":"Pa7LLCRh3k5grBZjedDUxA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Pa7LLCRh3k5grBZjedDUxA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.945093035697937},{"business_id":"flr22rkcBITW_8NntgCKUw","photo_id":"XG7J6l_j7abzqhlEohjGwA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XG7J6l_j7abzqhlEohjGwA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.945093035697937}]},"notebook_case":null}
